# Icons

- Import icons from `src/components/icons/`, not raw `central-icons` / `central-icons-filled` in screens
- New icon: add a wrapper via `createIcon` in `src/components/icons/`, export from `icons/index.ts`
- License and package aliases stay in `AGENTS.md`
